  "details": "EAC is simply not needed in VRC! It has not stopped the issue of malicious users, as they will find a way around EAC! It simply stops people from using mods for accessibility or using mods to help not be affected by malicious users! Please listen to your community. We have played this game for years and enjoyed it, but EAC will hinder the experience! If you want to fight against crashers and malicious modders, then get some help from the modders who have tried to stop the people making this game less fun! Please listen to us, we don't want to see our beloved game go down this path!",
